-- Kofi Collections — 0008_programme.sql, part 1 of 4: ledger, enums, shape checks, tables, audit vocabulary
-- GENERATED by supabase/scripts/split-0008.mjs from supabase/migrations/0008_programme.sql.
-- Run parts 1 → 4 in order, each on its own (one transaction each). Every part is
-- idempotent, so a failed part can simply be run again. Schema kofi only, plus
-- (part 4) the 'kofi-programme' bucket, "kofi programme …" storage policies and
